  "instruction": "Complete the task using command-line or batch-capable tools from Altium Designer, OrCAD Capture, or OpenSCAD. The neutral routed-board and locked-release IPC-2581 packages are on the desktop. Export etch-length reports from the routed-board data. Requirements: - Write `etch_lengths.csv` with columns `Net,Length_mil` for every routed net. - Write `diffpair_lengths.csv` with columns `Pair,Negative_mil,Positive_mil,Delta_mil` for every differential pair, where delta is the absolute length difference. [Software] For this workflow, the available entry points are OrCAD Capture at `C:\\Cadence\\SPB_24.1\\tools\\bin\\Capture.exe`, Altium Designer at `C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Altium\\AD17\\DXP.EXE`, and OpenSCAD at `C:\\Program Files\\OpenSCAD\\openscad.exe`.",
